pt halted after us-east had moved to v2.3.0, with an orchestrator error. I checked the state, found us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1, and retried the rollback. The retry completed in all three regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying, and INC-0001 already existed with the correct details, so I did not open a duplicate.\n\nStill open: the root cause of v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc, which are both marked unhealthy, and the orchestrator partial failure, which should be looked at separately.", "type": "text"}]}]}